-# >                  let mut table_output = vec![];
-# >                  for val in vals {
-# > ```
-#
-# > **Note**
-# > at every stage, the `toolkit check pr` will return a report of the few stages being run.
-#
-# - we run the toolkit once and it fails...
-# ```nushell
